@startuml IAMS_VisitScheduling_Communication_Clear
' Clear communication diagram — same layout style as library textbook example
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam object {
  BackgroundColor #DAE8FC
  BorderColor #6C8EBF
  FontSize 11
}

title Communication Diagram: Site Visit Scheduling — Supervisor (IAMS)

object "Institutional\nSupervisor" as Sup <<actor>> #FFFFFF
object ":UI:" as UI
object ":VisitScheduleAPI:" as API
object ":VisitScheduleHelper:" as VS

' Structural links (communication diagram association lines)
UI -- API
API -- VS
UI -- VS
Sup -- UI

' ── Phase 1: load ──
Sup -> UI : 1: openVisitScheduling()
UI -> API : 1.1: loadVisitSchedule()
API -> VS : 1.1.1: getAvailability(lecturerId)
API -> VS : 1.1.2: getSelectionsByDate(lecturerId)
API -> API : 1.1.3: validateSession()
VS --> API : rows
API --> UI : 1.1.4: scheduleData
UI -> UI : 1.2: displayCalendar()

' ── Phase 2: save & notify ──
Sup -> UI : 2: saveAndNotify(dates)
UI -> API : 2.1: saveAvailability()
API -> VS : 2.1.1: syncAvailability(dates)
VS -> VS : 2.1.1.1: updateDatabase()
API -> VS : 2.1.2: publishAvailability()
API -> API : 2.1.3: notifyStudents()
API -> VS : 2.1.3.1: createInSystemAlert()
API --> UI : 2.1.4: success
UI -> UI : 2.2: displaySuccess()

note left of UI
  Alt: if no dates selected
  → 2.2: displayError()
end note

@enduml

@startuml IAMS_VisitScheduling_Communication_Student_Clear
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam object {
  BackgroundColor #DAE8FC
  BorderColor #6C8EBF
  FontSize 11
}

title Communication Diagram: Site Visit Scheduling — Student (IAMS)

object "Student" as Stu <<actor>> #FFFFFF
object ":UI:" as UI
object ":VisitScheduleAPI:" as API
object ":VisitScheduleHelper:" as VS

UI -- API
API -- VS
UI -- VS
Stu -- UI

Stu -> UI : 1: openVisitSchedule()
UI -> API : 1.1: loadVisitSchedule()
API -> VS : 1.1.1: getPublishedAvailability()
API -> VS : 1.1.2: getMySelections()
VS --> API : rows
API --> UI : scheduleData
UI -> UI : 1.2: displayCalendar()

Stu -> UI : 2: submitSelections(dates)
UI -> API : 2.1: saveSelections()
API -> API : 2.1.1: validateDates()
API -> VS : 2.1.2: replaceSelections()
API -> VS : 2.1.3: notifySupervisor()
API --> UI : success
UI -> UI : 2.2: displaySuccess()

note left of UI
  Alt: invalid date
  → 2.2: displayError()
end note

@enduml
